{"id":"0815358d5b1d8115","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-provable-truth.md","title":"标准证明与模型真理的交集","display":"df-provable-truth — 标准证明与模型真理的交集","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-provable-truth","aliases":["91-df-provable-truth","91-df-proof-theoretic-truth","91-df-truth-from-provability"],"display":"df-provable-truth — 标准证明与模型真理的交集","depends_on":["[[91-df-truth-expansion]]","[[91-df-consistency-predicate]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-provable-truth"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-provable-truth</span><span>91-df-proof-theoretic-truth</span><span>91-df-truth-from-provability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-provable-truth — 标准证明与模型真理的交集"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7f5043d4200f56d1\" href=\"?note=7f5043d4200f56d1\" title=\"91-df-truth-expansion\">91-df-truth-expansion</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4e50c115b0d32044\" href=\"?note=4e50c115b0d32044\" title=\"91-df-consistency-predicate\">91-df-consistency-predicate</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 为递归可公理化理论，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M\">\\(\\mathfrak M\\)</span> 为解释算术编码与 T 的经典结构；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Th}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Th}(S)\\)</span> 始终使用外部有限标准证明。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{True}^{\\mathfrak M}_T,\\mathrm{ProvTrue}^{\\mathfrak M}_{S,T}\">\\(\\mathrm{True}^{\\mathfrak M}_T,\\mathrm{ProvTrue}^{\\mathfrak M}_{S,T}\\)</span> 为下述句子集。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}provable\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Th}(S)\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_S}:S\\vdash\\varphi\\},\\quad\n\\mathrm{True}^{\\mathfrak M}_T\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_S}:\\mathfrak M\\models T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\},\\quad\n\\mathrm{ProvTrue}^{\\mathfrak M}_{S,T}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Th}(S)\\cap\\mathrm{True}^{\\mathfrak M}_T.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}provable\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Th}(S)\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_S}:S\\vdash\\varphi\\},\\quad\n\\mathrm{True}^{\\mathfrak M}_T\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_S}:\\mathfrak M\\models T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\},\\quad\n\\mathrm{ProvTrue}^{\\mathfrak M}_{S,T}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Th}(S)\\cap\\mathrm{True}^{\\mathfrak M}_T.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若全部标准 S 定理被模型的 T 判真，此交集就是 Th(S)。模型的 T 判真尚不等于外部 φ 真，除非另有恰当的 T-out 或语义正确性。\n在非标准算术模型中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M\\models\\mathrm{Prov}_S(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\">\\(\\mathfrak M\\models\\mathrm{Prov}_S(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\)</span> 可由非标准的“证明代码”满足，不等价于外部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\vdash\\varphi\">\\(S\\vdash\\varphi\\)</span>；旧表将二者混为集合成员条件。标准模型和正确的证明关系解释才允许替换。\n这些集合是本地辅助定义，逐句去引号不能自动推出统一证明保持真理的全局反射原则。</p>\n<p>来源：§8.2、§8.6、Chapter 22 的证明/模型反射区别。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-truth-expansion","status":"resolved","id":"7f5043d4200f56d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-expansion]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-consistency-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"4e50c115b0d32044","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-consistency-predicate]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Th}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{True}^{\\mathfrak M}_T,\\mathrm{ProvTrue}^{\\mathfrak M}_{S,T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}provable\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Th}(S)\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_S}:S\\vdash\\varphi\\},\\quad\n\\mathrm{True}^{\\mathfrak M}_T\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_S}:\\mathfrak M\\models T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\},\\quad\n\\mathrm{ProvTrue}^{\\mathfrak M}_{S,T}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Th}(S)\\cap\\mathrm{True}^{\\mathfrak M}_T.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M\\models\\mathrm{Prov}_S(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"S\\vdash\\varphi","display":false}],"bytes":1766,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-70","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-provable-truth]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-74","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-df-capture-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-classical-extension.md]]\n[[91-df-coded-syntax.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-axioms.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conjunction-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-conservative-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conservativity-proof.md]]\n[[91-df-consistency-predicate.md]]\n[[91-df-continuity.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-sc